SUMMARY:Miracle on 34th Street Lighting
LOCATION:700 block of W. 34th Street\, Hampden\, 726 W 34th St\, Baltimore
 \, MD 21211
DESCRIPTION:Hampden's famous block of over-the-top rowhouse Christmas ligh
 ts switches on Saturday at 6 p.m. The lights stay on nightly through New Y
 ear's Day\, until midnight on Fridays and Saturdays. Free. Details: https:
 //weekendscout.app/e/baltimore/miracle-on-34th-street-lighting/
